# Directory bookmarks, `name path` per line (# comments ok). `shortcuts` turns
# them into shell aliases, zsh named dirs and lf/nvim maps; bmd <name> appends the cwd.
ho   $HOME
cf   $HOME/.config
sc   $HOME/.scripts
dt   $HOME/.local/share
lb   $HOME/.local/bin
cac  $HOME/.cache
# dl   $HOME/downloads
# mm   $HOME/music
# pp   $HOME/pictures
# vv   $HOME/videos
